{"id": null, "n": "0575009", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0575009", "type": "mod", "text": "（開府…寺）三十七字【大】，南天竺國【宋】【元】【甲】，唐南天竺國【明】【乙】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0575010", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0575010", "type": "mod", "text": "藏【大】，藏金剛智與【宋】【元】【明】【乙】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0575011", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0575011", "type": "mod", "text": "峯【大】，〔－〕【宋】【元】【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0575012", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0575012", "type": "mod", "text": "法【大】，〔－〕【宋】【元】【明】【甲】【乙】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0575013", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0575013", "type": "mod", "text": "及【大】，佛【明】【乙】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0575014", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0575014", "type": "mod", "text": "唯【大】，惟【宋】【元】【明】【乙】"}
